{"id":"f810bf542334e0d1","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md","title":"Smooth Vector Bundle and Section Data","display":"df-smooth-vector-bundle-data — Smooth Vector Bundle and Section Data","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data","aliases":["58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data"],"display":"df-smooth-vector-bundle-data — Smooth Vector Bundle and Section Data","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-manifold-coordinate-data.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-smooth-vector-bundle-data — Smooth Vector Bundle and Section Data"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"efe8e2f202483a88\" href=\"?note=efe8e2f202483a88\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-manifold-coordinate-data.md\">../batch03/58-df-manifold-coordinate-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d87c5d842ade903d\" href=\"?note=d87c5d842ade903d\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md\">../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c5f44e08576c6b2e\" href=\"?note=c5f44e08576c6b2e\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md\">../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"71fe0dc4c8613e69\" href=\"?note=71fe0dc4c8613e69\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md\">../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=\\langle\\pi,E,M,k,S,r,A,O,\\mathcal T\\rangle\">\\(D=\\langle\\pi,E,M,k,S,r,A,O,\\mathcal T\\rangle\\)</span> 为有限记录，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle\">\\(S=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle\\)</span>；运算记号均从当前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 投影。记录格式错误时下列关系为假。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\">\\(k\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\)</span> 使用通常域运算。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_p=\\{e\\in E:\\pi(e)=p\\}\">\\(E_p=\\{e\\in E:\\pi(e)=p\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A(p)\">\\(A(p)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(p)\">\\(O(p)\\)</span> 分别是纤维加法和标量乘法；二元运算以有序对为自变量。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_{\\mathbb R}=1\">\\(d_{\\mathbb R}=1\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_{\\mathbb C}=2\">\\(d_{\\mathbb C}=2\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{real}_{\\mathbb R,r}(z)=z\">\\(\\operatorname{real}_{\\mathbb R,r}(z)=z\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{real}_{\\mathbb C,r}(z)=\\langle\\Re z(0),\\Im z(0),\\ldots,\\Re z(r-1),\\Im z(r-1)\\rangle\\in\\mathbb R^{2r}\">\\(\\operatorname{real}_{\\mathbb C,r}(z)=\\langle\\Re z(0),\\Im z(0),\\ldots,\\Re z(r-1),\\Im z(r-1)\\rangle\\in\\mathbb R^{2r}\\)</span>。有限向量连接记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x^\\frown y\">\\(x^\\frown y\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t=\\langle U,W,\\phi,h\\rangle\\in\\mathcal T\">\\(t=\\langle U,W,\\phi,h\\rangle\\in\\mathcal T\\)</span> 的平凡化 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> 取值于有序对积 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\times k^r\">\\(U\\times k^r\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h_0(e),h_1(e)\">\\(h_0(e),h_1(e)\\)</span> 是其两分量。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta_t=\\{\\langle e,\\phi(\\pi(e))^\\frown\\operatorname{real}_{k,r}(h_1(e))\\rangle:e\\in\\pi^{-1}[U]\\}\">\\(\\beta_t=\\{\\langle e,\\phi(\\pi(e))^\\frown\\operatorname{real}_{k,r}(h_1(e))\\rangle:e\\in\\pi^{-1}[U]\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_t=\\{x^\\frown\\operatorname{real}_{k,r}(z):x\\in W,z\\in k^r\\}\">\\(W_t=\\{x^\\frown\\operatorname{real}_{k,r}(z):x\\in W,z\\in k^r\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_E(D)\">\\(\\tau_E(D)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_E(D)\">\\(\\mathcal A_E(D)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma(D)\">\\(\\Gamma(D)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega^1(D)\">\\(\\Omega^1(D)\\)</span> 由下式定义，只在相应的合法记录域使用。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V^M\">\\(V^M\\)</span> 缩写定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 的集合函数类。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C(S)\">\\(C(S)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(S,p)\">\\(T(S,p)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak X(S)\">\\(\\mathfrak X(S)\\)</span> 使用指定光滑结构。实数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(a\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=\\mathbb C\">\\(k=\\mathbb C\\)</span> 的标量作用中经通常实子域嵌入；切导子始终实线性。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothChart}\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothChart}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"efe8e2f202483a88\" href=\"?note=efe8e2f202483a88\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-manifold-coordinate-data.md\">../batch03/58-df-manifold-coordinate-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"c5f44e08576c6b2e\" href=\"?note=c5f44e08576c6b2e\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md\">../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}\">\\(\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"71fe0dc4c8613e69\" href=\"?note=71fe0dc4c8613e69\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md\">../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothMapStructure}\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothMapStructure}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"d87c5d842ade903d\" href=\"?note=d87c5d842ade903d\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md\">../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VectorSpace}\">\\(\\mathrm{VectorSpace}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BundleChartData}\">\\(\\mathrm{BundleChartData}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ScalarSmooth}\">\\(\\mathrm{ScalarSmooth}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{id}\">\\(\\mathrm{id}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{BundleChartData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,k)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nD=\\langle\\pi,E,M,k,S,r,A,O,\\mathcal T\\rangle\n\\land S=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}_{58}(S)\\\\\n&amp;\\land k\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\land r\\in\\omega\n\\land\\pi\\in M^E\\land\\operatorname{ran}\\pi=M\\land A,O\\in V^M\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(E_p,k,A(p),O(p),+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathcal T\\;\\exists U,W,\\phi,h\\;\\bigl[\nt=\\langle U,W,\\phi,h\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{SmoothChart}_{58}(\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle,S)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land h\\in(U\\times k^r)^{\\pi^{-1}[U]}\\land\\operatorname{ran}h=U\\times k^r\n\\land\\forall e,e&#39;\\in\\pi^{-1}[U]\\;(h(e)=h(e&#39;)\\to e=e&#39;)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall e\\in\\pi^{-1}[U]\\;h_0(e)=\\pi(e)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall p\\in U\\;\\forall e,e&#39;\\in E_p\\;\\forall a\\in k\\;\n\\bigl(h_1(A(p)(e,e&#39;))=h_1(e)+h_1(e&#39;)\n\\land h_1(O(p)(a,e))=a\\,h_1(e)\\bigr)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\exists\\langle U,W,\\phi,h\\rangle\\in\\mathcal T\\;p\\in U.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{BundleChartData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,k)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nD=\\langle\\pi,E,M,k,S,r,A,O,\\mathcal T\\rangle\n\\land S=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}_{58}(S)\\\\\n&amp;\\land k\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\land r\\in\\omega\n\\land\\pi\\in M^E\\land\\operatorname{ran}\\pi=M\\land A,O\\in V^M\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(E_p,k,A(p),O(p),+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathcal T\\;\\exists U,W,\\phi,h\\;\\bigl[\nt=\\langle U,W,\\phi,h\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{SmoothChart}_{58}(\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle,S)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land h\\in(U\\times k^r)^{\\pi^{-1}[U]}\\land\\operatorname{ran}h=U\\times k^r\n\\land\\forall e,e&#39;\\in\\pi^{-1}[U]\\;(h(e)=h(e&#39;)\\to e=e&#39;)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall e\\in\\pi^{-1}[U]\\;h_0(e)=\\pi(e)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall p\\in U\\;\\forall e,e&#39;\\in E_p\\;\\forall a\\in k\\;\n\\bigl(h_1(A(p)(e,e&#39;))=h_1(e)+h_1(e&#39;)\n\\land h_1(O(p)(a,e))=a\\,h_1(e)\\bigr)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\exists\\langle U,W,\\phi,h\\rangle\\in\\mathcal T\\;p\\in U.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{BundleChartData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,k)\\to\n\\mathcal A_E(D)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\pi^{-1}[U],W_t,\\beta_t\\rangle:t=\\langle U,W,\\phi,h\\rangle\\in\\mathcal T\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{BundleChartData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,k)\\to\n\\tau_E(D)\\coloneqq\\{B\\subseteq E:\\forall t=\\langle U,W,\\phi,h\\rangle\\in\\mathcal T\\;\n\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}_S(\\beta_t[B\\cap\\pi^{-1}[U]],n+d_kr)\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{BundleChartData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,k)\\to\n\\mathcal A_E(D)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\pi^{-1}[U],W_t,\\beta_t\\rangle:t=\\langle U,W,\\phi,h\\rangle\\in\\mathcal T\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{BundleChartData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,k)\\to\n\\tau_E(D)\\coloneqq\\{B\\subseteq E:\\forall t=\\langle U,W,\\phi,h\\rangle\\in\\mathcal T\\;\n\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}_S(\\beta_t[B\\cap\\pi^{-1}[U]],n+d_kr)\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,k)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{BundleChartData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,k)\n\\land\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(E,\\tau_E(D),\\mathcal A_E(D),n+d_kr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,k)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{BundleChartData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,k)\n\\land\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(E,\\tau_E(D),\\mathcal A_E(D),n+d_kr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma(D)\\coloneqq\\{s\\in E^M:{}&amp;\\pi\\circ s=\\mathrm{id}_M\\land\n\\mathrm{SmoothMapStructure}_S(s,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n,E,\\tau_E(D),\\mathcal A_E(D),n+d_kr)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma(D)\\coloneqq\\{s\\in E^M:{}&amp;\\pi\\circ s=\\mathrm{id}_M\\land\n\\mathrm{SmoothMapStructure}_S(s,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n,E,\\tau_E(D),\\mathcal A_E(D),n+d_kr)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ScalarSmooth}_{58}(f,S,k)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}_{58}(S)\\land k\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\land f\\in k^M\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl[(k=\\mathbb R\\land f\\in C(S))\n\\lor(k=\\mathbb C\\land\\{\\langle p,\\Re f(p)\\rangle:p\\in M\\}\\in C(S)\n\\land\\{\\langle p,\\Im f(p)\\rangle:p\\in M\\}\\in C(S))\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ScalarSmooth}_{58}(f,S,k)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}_{58}(S)\\land k\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\land f\\in k^M\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl[(k=\\mathbb R\\land f\\in C(S))\n\\lor(k=\\mathbb C\\land\\{\\langle p,\\Re f(p)\\rangle:p\\in M\\}\\in C(S)\n\\land\\{\\langle p,\\Im f(p)\\rangle:p\\in M\\}\\in C(S))\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Omega^1(D)\\coloneqq\\bigl\\{\\eta\\in\\left(\\bigcup_{p\\in M}E_p^{T(S,p)}\\right)^M:{}&amp;\n\\forall p\\in M\\;\\bigl[\\eta(p)\\in E_p^{T(S,p)}\n\\land\\forall u,v\\in T(S,p)\\;\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\eta(p)(au+bv)=A(p)(O(p)(a,\\eta(p)(u)),O(p)(b,\\eta(p)(v)))\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X\\in\\mathfrak X(S)\\;\\{\\langle p,\\eta(p)(X(p))\\rangle:p\\in M\\}\\in\\Gamma(D)\\bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\Omega^1(D)\\coloneqq\\bigl\\{\\eta\\in\\left(\\bigcup_{p\\in M}E_p^{T(S,p)}\\right)^M:{}&amp;\n\\forall p\\in M\\;\\bigl[\\eta(p)\\in E_p^{T(S,p)}\n\\land\\forall u,v\\in T(S,p)\\;\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\eta(p)(au+bv)=A(p)(O(p)(a,\\eta(p)(u)),O(p)(b,\\eta(p)(v)))\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X\\in\\mathfrak X(S)\\;\\{\\langle p,\\eta(p)(X(p))\\rangle:p\\in M\\}\\in\\Gamma(D)\\bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\na,b\\in k\\land s,t\\in\\Gamma(D)\\to\n\\mathrm{SectionCombination}_{58}(D,a,s,b,t)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle p,A(p)(O(p)(a,s(p)),O(p)(b,t(p)))\\rangle:p\\in M\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ScalarSmooth}_{58}(f,S,k)\\land s\\in\\Gamma(D)\\to\n\\mathrm{SectionProduct}_{58}(D,f,s)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle p,O(p)(f(p),s(p))\\rangle:p\\in M\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ScalarSmooth}_{58}(f,S,k)\\land p\\in M\\land v\\in T(S,p)\\to\n\\mathrm{ScalarDifferential}_{58}(f,v,S,k)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\nv(f),&amp;k=\\mathbb R,\\\\\nv(\\{\\langle q,\\Re f(q)\\rangle:q\\in M\\})+\\mathrm i\\,v(\\{\\langle q,\\Im f(q)\\rangle:q\\in M\\}),&amp;k=\\mathbb C.\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\na,b\\in k\\land s,t\\in\\Gamma(D)\\to\n\\mathrm{SectionCombination}_{58}(D,a,s,b,t)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle p,A(p)(O(p)(a,s(p)),O(p)(b,t(p)))\\rangle:p\\in M\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ScalarSmooth}_{58}(f,S,k)\\land s\\in\\Gamma(D)\\to\n\\mathrm{SectionProduct}_{58}(D,f,s)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle p,O(p)(f(p),s(p))\\rangle:p\\in M\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ScalarSmooth}_{58}(f,S,k)\\land p\\in M\\land v\\in T(S,p)\\to\n\\mathrm{ScalarDifferential}_{58}(f,v,S,k)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\nv(f),&amp;k=\\mathbb R,\\\\\nv(\\{\\langle q,\\Re f(q)\\rangle:q\\in M\\})+\\mathrm i\\,v(\\{\\langle q,\\Im f(q)\\rangle:q\\in M\\}),&amp;k=\\mathbb C.\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SmoothVectorBundle}_S(\\pi,E,M,k)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists D\\;\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,k).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SmoothVectorBundle}_S(\\pi,E,M,k)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists D\\;\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,k).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>补齐有限秩实或复光滑向量丛、指定纤维运算、总空间光滑结构、光滑截面和 E 值一形式。全局截面光滑性的检验依赖实际构造的图册，不是“标准光滑性”占位条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-manifold-coordinate-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"efe8e2f202483a88","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-manifold-coordinate-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"d87c5d842ade903d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"c5f44e08576c6b2e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"71fe0dc4c8613e69","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-manifold-coordinate-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"efe8e2f202483a88","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{SmoothChart}$ 取 [[../batch03/58-df-manifold-coordinate-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"c5f44e08576c6b2e","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}$ 取 [[../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"71fe0dc4c8613e69","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}$ 取 [[../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"d87c5d842ade903d","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{SmoothMapStructure}$ 取 [[../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{VectorSpace}$ 取 [[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"D=\\langle\\pi,E,M,k,S,r,A,O,\\mathcal T\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"S=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}","display":false},{"tex":"E_p=\\{e\\in E:\\pi(e)=p\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A(p)","display":false},{"tex":"O(p)","display":false},{"tex":"d_{\\mathbb R}=1","display":false},{"tex":"d_{\\mathbb C}=2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{real}_{\\mathbb R,r}(z)=z","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{real}_{\\mathbb C,r}(z)=\\langle\\Re z(0),\\Im z(0),\\ldots,\\Re z(r-1),\\Im z(r-1)\\rangle\\in\\mathbb R^{2r}","display":false},{"tex":"x^\\frown y","display":false},{"tex":"t=\\langle U,W,\\phi,h\\rangle\\in\\mathcal T","display":false},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"U\\times k^r","display":false},{"tex":"h_0(e),h_1(e)","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta_t=\\{\\langle e,\\phi(\\pi(e))^\\frown\\operatorname{real}_{k,r}(h_1(e))\\rangle:e\\in\\pi^{-1}[U]\\}","display":false},{"tex":"W_t=\\{x^\\frown\\operatorname{real}_{k,r}(z):x\\in W,z\\in k^r\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_E(D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A_E(D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma(D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega^1(D)","display":false},{"tex":"V^M","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"C(S)","display":false},{"tex":"T(S,p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak X(S)","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"k=\\mathbb C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SmoothChart}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SmoothMapStructure}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VectorSpace}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BundleChartData}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ScalarSmooth}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{id}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{BundleChartData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,k)\\leftrightarrow{}&\nD=\\langle\\pi,E,M,k,S,r,A,O,\\mathcal T\\rangle\n\\land S=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}_{58}(S)\\\\\n&\\land k\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\land r\\in\\omega\n\\land\\pi\\in M^E\\land\\operatorname{ran}\\pi=M\\land A,O\\in V^M\\\\\n&\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(E_p,k,A(p),O(p),+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathcal T\\;\\exists U,W,\\phi,h\\;\\bigl[\nt=\\langle U,W,\\phi,h\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{SmoothChart}_{58}(\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle,S)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land h\\in(U\\times k^r)^{\\pi^{-1}[U]}\\land\\operatorname{ran}h=U\\times k^r\n\\land\\forall e,e'\\in\\pi^{-1}[U]\\;(h(e)=h(e')\\to e=e')\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall e\\in\\pi^{-1}[U]\\;h_0(e)=\\pi(e)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall p\\in U\\;\\forall e,e'\\in E_p\\;\\forall a\\in k\\;\n\\bigl(h_1(A(p)(e,e'))=h_1(e)+h_1(e')\n\\land h_1(O(p)(a,e))=a\\,h_1(e)\\bigr)\\bigr]\\\\\n&\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\exists\\langle U,W,\\phi,h\\rangle\\in\\mathcal T\\;p\\in U.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{BundleChartData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,k)\\to\n\\mathcal A_E(D)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\pi^{-1}[U],W_t,\\beta_t\\rangle:t=\\langle U,W,\\phi,h\\rangle\\in\\mathcal T\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{BundleChartData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,k)\\to\n\\tau_E(D)\\coloneqq\\{B\\subseteq E:\\forall t=\\langle U,W,\\phi,h\\rangle\\in\\mathcal T\\;\n\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}_S(\\beta_t[B\\cap\\pi^{-1}[U]],n+d_kr)\\}.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,k)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{BundleChartData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,k)\n\\land\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(E,\\tau_E(D),\\mathcal A_E(D),n+d_kr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma(D)\\coloneqq\\{s\\in E^M:{}&\\pi\\circ s=\\mathrm{id}_M\\land\n\\mathrm{SmoothMapStructure}_S(s,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n,E,\\tau_E(D),\\mathcal A_E(D),n+d_kr)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ScalarSmooth}_{58}(f,S,k)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}_{58}(S)\\land k\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\land f\\in k^M\\\\\n&\\land\\bigl[(k=\\mathbb R\\land f\\in C(S))\n\\lor(k=\\mathbb C\\land\\{\\langle p,\\Re f(p)\\rangle:p\\in M\\}\\in C(S)\n\\land\\{\\langle p,\\Im f(p)\\rangle:p\\in M\\}\\in C(S))\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Omega^1(D)\\coloneqq\\bigl\\{\\eta\\in\\left(\\bigcup_{p\\in M}E_p^{T(S,p)}\\right)^M:{}&\n\\forall p\\in M\\;\\bigl[\\eta(p)\\in E_p^{T(S,p)}\n\\land\\forall u,v\\in T(S,p)\\;\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\\\\n&\\eta(p)(au+bv)=A(p)(O(p)(a,\\eta(p)(u)),O(p)(b,\\eta(p)(v)))\\bigr]\\\\\n&\\land\\forall X\\in\\mathfrak X(S)\\;\\{\\langle p,\\eta(p)(X(p))\\rangle:p\\in M\\}\\in\\Gamma(D)\\bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\na,b\\in k\\land s,t\\in\\Gamma(D)\\to\n\\mathrm{SectionCombination}_{58}(D,a,s,b,t)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle p,A(p)(O(p)(a,s(p)),O(p)(b,t(p)))\\rangle:p\\in M\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ScalarSmooth}_{58}(f,S,k)\\land s\\in\\Gamma(D)\\to\n\\mathrm{SectionProduct}_{58}(D,f,s)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle p,O(p)(f(p),s(p))\\rangle:p\\in M\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ScalarSmooth}_{58}(f,S,k)\\land p\\in M\\land v\\in T(S,p)\\to\n\\mathrm{ScalarDifferential}_{58}(f,v,S,k)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\nv(f),&k=\\mathbb R,\\\\\nv(\\{\\langle q,\\Re f(q)\\rangle:q\\in M\\})+\\mathrm i\\,v(\\{\\langle q,\\Im f(q)\\rangle:q\\in M\\}),&k=\\mathbb C.\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SmoothVectorBundle}_S(\\pi,E,M,k)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists D\\;\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,k).","display":true}],"bytes":6250,"backlinks":[{"id":"84333fc892f1be29","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}$ 取 [[../batch17/58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"2c7d1de20e312049","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}$ 取 [[../batch17/58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"904b0609d7cbf868","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{SectionCombination}$、$\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}$ 取 [[../batch17/58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"2ee05b1995ae05f1","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{SectionCombination}$、$\\mathrm{SectionProduct}$、$\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}$ 取 [[58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"0b88ba4114f012c8","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}$ 取 [[../batch17/58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1195","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md|58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["efe8e2f202483a88","592f9cfb66a507c2","d87c5d842ade903d","c5f44e08576c6b2e","36d7463d215be751","71fe0dc4c8613e69"]}